  "notes": "OFF: `callee` recovers `(unsigned char *, int)`, but nothing carries that to `caller`, whose own parameter stays `unsigned long a0` and whose caller passes a bare `0x402000`. `vfmt` and `thunk` are pinned here so the ON arm can be compared argument for argument."
